    "description": "Having 2 parsers concatenated with \nJsonParserSequence.createFlattened(parser1, parser2)\n.\n\nIf the second parser is on a token that is not null and should not be skipped, the JsonParserSequence will still skip it. JsonParserSequence's \nnextToken()\ncalls nextToken() on the new delegate which may cause that we miss a token.\n\nFor more details : \nforum question\n\nI'll open a PR for this.\n\nThanks."
